phrase: list count gaps any size {gap}
slot: gap int
test: list=1,3,5,6,8 gap=2
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="gaps matched: 3" errors=0 n=5 res=[1,3,5,6,8] cache=0 hits=0
